# HM08 Dive (FLAG_RECEIVED_HM08, 34) and HM04 Strength (FLAG_RECEIVED_HM04, 17) taught to the lead as a player teaches
# them: Route 128's trench and Seafloor Cavern's boulders. Slot 0 (Cut) and slot 3 (Rock Smash) keep their order:
# Rock Smash is still needed in the cavern, so Strength takes Cut's slot and Dive Muddy Water's.
party-move 0 0 MOVE_STRENGTH
party-move 0 2 MOVE_DIVE
party-level 0 55
